                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game was delayed for a whole year and I can see why...\nRandom generation is predictable.   \nThe exit will be found in the lower-right of almost every maze.\nMonsters will be lurking behind every locked door.\nThere's no strategy, just constant grinding, grinding, grinding.\nAnd when you get to the next level and the next...\nThe dungeons and the creatures look exactly the same.\nGrind some more...",
